  "stem": "A particle moving along x-axis has acceleration f, at time t, given by $f = f_{o}(1 - \\frac{t}{T})$, where $f_{0}$ and T are constants. The particle at t = 0 has zero velocity. At the instant when f = 0, the particle's velocity is?",
  "options": {
    "A": "½ $f_{0}T$",
    "B": "$f_{0}T$",
    "C": "$\\frac{1}{2}f_{0}T^{2}$",
    "D": "$f_{0}T^{2}$"
  },
  "answer": {
    "keys": [
      "A"
